## Must match

- Title **Admin Atlas** + subtitle *Supply · demand · activity on the map — not live tracking*
- Actions: Export · Refresh · Share view
- Period pills + City / Status / Category / Layer filters
- Module tabs: Overview · Events · Signups · Heat · Coverage · Ops (orange border active, not filled pills)
- KPI row: Live/upcoming · Pending (+ urgent) · Signup clusters · Coverage gaps
- Map: coloured pins, heat halos, signup clusters, legend, ops badges, growth timeline scrubber
- Theme via existing admin tokens — never hardcode dark-only

## Product constraints

- Aggregated ops only — **no live user trails**
- Reuse Mapbox + `AdminPageShell` / analytics period chrome
